<quiz>
  <question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>Cyclic quadrilateral with algebra</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>\(ABCD\) is a cyclic quadrilateral. Angle \(ABC = (2x + {@m@})^\circ\) and angle \(ADC = (3x - {@ll@})^\circ\).</p>

<div style="text-align:center;" role="img" aria-label="A cyclic quadrilateral ABCD inside a circle. The angle at B is marked (2x + {#m#}) degrees and the angle at D is marked (3x minus {#ll#}) degrees.">
[[jsxgraph width="380px" height="380px"]]
var board = JXG.JSXGraph.initBoard(divid, {boundingbox:[-1.5,1.5,1.5,-1.5], axis:false, showCopyright:false, showNavigation:false, keepAspectRatio:true});
var r = Math.PI/180;
var a0 = 200*r;
var angs = [a0, a0+{#pp#}*r, a0+({#pp#}+{#qq#})*r, a0+({#pp#}+{#qq#}+{#rr#})*r];
var names = ['A','B','C','D'];
var P = [];
for (var i=0; i<4; i++) {
  P.push(board.create('point',[Math.cos(angs[i]),Math.sin(angs[i])],
    {name:names[i], fixed:true, size:2, label:{offset:[14*Math.cos(angs[i])-4, 14*Math.sin(angs[i])]}}));
}
board.create('circle',[[0,0],1],{fixed:true,strokeColor:'#333'});
board.create('polygon',P,{fixed:true,fillColor:'none',borders:{strokeColor:'#333'},vertices:{visible:true}});
board.create('nonreflexangle',[P[0],P[1],P[2]],{radius:0.22,withLabel:false,fillColor:'#1f5fa8',fillOpacity:0.3,strokeColor:'#1f5fa8',fixed:true,label:{fontSize:13,strokeColor:'#000'}});
board.create('nonreflexangle',[P[2],P[3],P[0]],{radius:0.22,withLabel:false,fillColor:'#c0392b',fillOpacity:0.3,strokeColor:'#c0392b',fixed:true,label:{fontSize:13,strokeColor:'#000'}});
function angLabel(brd, A, V, C, t) { var ax = A.X() - V.X(), ay = A.Y() - V.Y(), cx = C.X() - V.X(), cy = C.Y() - V.Y(); var la = Math.sqrt(ax*ax + ay*ay), lc = Math.sqrt(cx*cx + cy*cy); var ux = ax/la + cx/lc, uy = ay/la + cy/lc, lu = Math.sqrt(ux*ux + uy*uy); var h = Math.acos(Math.max(-1, Math.min(1, (ax*cx + ay*cy)/(la*lc))))/2; var d = Math.min(0.72, Math.max(0.44, 0.15/Math.tan(h))); brd.create('text', [V.X() + d*ux/lu, V.Y() + d*uy/lu, t], {anchorX:'middle', anchorY:'middle', fontSize:13, fixed:true, highlight:false, cssStyle:'background:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);padding:0 2px;border-radius:3px'}); }
angLabel(board, P[0], P[1], P[2], '(2x+{#m#})°');
angLabel(board, P[2], P[3], P[0], '(3x−{#ll#})°');
[[/jsxgraph]]
</div>

<p>(a) Find the value of \(x\). [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]</p>
<div>[[feedback:prt1]]</div>

<p>(b) Find angle \(ABC\). [[input:ans2]]\(^\circ\) [[validation:ans2]]</p>
<div>[[feedback:prt2]]</div>

<p>(c) Find angle \(ADC\). [[input:ans3]]\(^\circ\) [[validation:ans3]]</p>
<div>[[feedback:prt3]]</div>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<h4>Worked solution</h4>
<p><strong>(a)</strong> Opposite angles of a cyclic quadrilateral add up to \(180^\circ\):</p>
<p>\((2x + {@m@}) + (3x - {@ll@}) = 180\)<br>
\(5x = {@180+ll-m@}\)<br>
\(x = {@x0@}\)</p>
<p><strong>(b)</strong> \(ABC = 2({@x0@}) + {@m@} = {@ta2@}^\circ\).</p>
<p><strong>(c)</strong> \(ADC = 3({@x0@}) - {@ll@} = {@ta3@}^\circ\).<br>
Check: \({@ta2@} + {@ta3@} = 180\), as required.</p>]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
